- job offers accompanied by the required documents must be sent through the application form

online by Tuesday, November 10, 2026, at 23.59. This notice of competition is also visible on www.bellinzona.ch/asks and can be found at the multifunctional offices of the districts. For further information please contact Bellinzona Sport, Mr Andrea Laffranchini (tel. 058 203 17 10). The Governing Council reserves the right not to proceed with the absence of candidates/responsible for the purpose. COUNCIL DIRECTIVE Bellinzona, 13 October 2026

